Write a two-page IAM policy for a fictional 50-person company. Include: a joiner/mover/leaver workflow (who provisions, who approves, who revokes, and within what SLA); an MFA rollout plan naming which roles require it on day one; a role matrix mapping three job functions to systems and permission levels under least privilege; and a quarterly access-review process with an owner. Deliverable: the policy document plus your role matrix as a table. Keep every control tied to one of the four IAM layers.

