Run a 45-minute tabletop exercise with a partner (or solo, writing both sides). Scenario: ransomware found on two finance workstations at 9 AM. 1) Preparation check: list the roles, contacts, and tools you would need — note what is missing. 2) Detection & Analysis: write the five questions you must answer before containing (patient zero? spread? data exfiltration?). 3) Containment/Eradication/Recovery: sequence your actions and justify the order. 4) Draft the internal notification for staff and the executive update. 5) Hold the lessons-learned: three things to improve. Keep the whole exercise to two pages.

