Produce a two-page incident response plan for a fictional 40-person company plus a one-page lessons-learned template. The plan must cover: IR team roles and escalation contacts, the four NIST phases with entry/exit criteria for each, evidence-preservation steps, and communication rules (who speaks, who is told what, when legal is looped in). The template must capture timeline, root cause, impact, response effectiveness, and action items with owners. Deliverable: plan plus template as a single PDF.

