- **Capstone** — full-scope practice engagement: scope document, threat model, assessment, report, presentation.
- **Threat model** — what you protect, who threatens it, and how; focuses the assessment on what matters.
- **Methodology** — the repeatable process interviewers probe: recon, scanning, exploitation, post-exploitation, reporting. Know yours cold.
- **Executive communication** — translating findings into business risk, cost, and likelihood; separates hires from applicants.
- **Remediation roadmap** — fixes sequenced by risk reduction per effort, quick wins first.
- **Portfolio** — sanitized reports, lab writeups, and tooling proving skill; never client data beyond authorization.
- **Honest credentials** — list only real experience and training; invented claims collapse in technical interviews.
- **Interview topics** — networking fundamentals, web basics, methodology walkthrough, report samples, ethics and authorization scenarios.

